  <b><size:15>3 added · 8 modified (6 functional + 2 cosmetic) · 12 unchanged</size></b>
  <b>Unchanged in all 3 stages:</b> Order, Chef, Cashier, Staff, MenuItem, Money, RegularCustomer
  <back:#DFF5E1>   </back> new in Stage 3    <back:#FFF4CC>   </back> changed in Stage 3 (functional changes)
